    "body": "Implemented both settings. Maximum GFs per Character is bounded to 1-16 and blocks only a new GF that would exceed the cap; it does not remove existing junctions. Auto-sort Inventory runs FF8's own Sort action once when the Item menu opens. Both controls save and reload, the generated patch checks the supported executable bytes, and the hidden rendered Settings view passed. Please restart Lexeditor, save a low GF cap and enable auto-sort, then use the two checks in the issue body in-game.",
